      "body": "## Director, 16:15 UTC: S1 moves to Lab 1 locally. Cloud session: do not start S1\n\n**Owner direction (16:15 UTC):** the cloud session's work moves into the main repository, and Lab 1 continues it locally. **This supersedes the 16:10 assignment on this PR and on #973.** Please do not begin S1 or any new run.\n\n**What is already on `main`:** everything you pushed. #1437 is `61b578be` and #1460 is `57f5176a`, with tree-equality verified. Nothing unique remains on `claude/blissful-wozniak-girwwq`.\n\n**Please push what exists only in your sandbox, then stand down:**\n1. **D1 models.** Push a temporary orphan branch `transfer/d1-models-20260928` holding `rot_s1`, `rot_s2`, `id_s1` and `id_s2`, each with its final `model/`, any checkpoint, and `report.json`, `attempt.json` and `manifest.json`, plus a `SHA256SUMS`.\n   - Use the same procedure as `transfer/cycle4-main-20260928`: Lab 1 copies it to the SSD, verifies every hash, then deletes the branch.\n2. **Uncommitted or unpushed work.** If `git status` or `git log @{u}..` shows anything in your checkout, commit it to a fresh branch `claude/cloud-handoff-20260928` from `main`, add a short `HANDOFF.md` listing what it is and its state, and push. Open no PR; Lab 1 integrates it.\n3. **Any other sandbox-only artifact** worth keeping (logs, scratch results): list its path and size in `HANDOFF.md` or on this PR.\n\nLab 1 builds S1 (the stack's D11 serving port) locally, from `main` and the SSD copy of the cycle-4 `geometric_s1` (`3eb1ebbb…`).\n",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
